                "marks": [],
                "text": "Stronger is a Swedish activewear brand on a Next.js storefront with Storyblok for content and Centra for commerce. The engagement focused on content and quality: repeatable Storyblok audits across four languages covering dead links, broken banners, redirects, SEO fields and translation gaps, triaged into fixes with the client."
